sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod faithfully reproduces Vertebrate embryonic autopod (Mus musculus distal Hox/Gli3 allelic series & postaxial hexadactylous autopod radiograph) morphology" ;
        dcterms:description "The simulation script(s) 2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Vertebrate embryonic autopod (Mus musculus distal Hox/Gli3 allelic series & postaxial hexadactylous autopod radiograph) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-hox-turing-polydactyly-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py; output: docs/media/hox_turing_polydactyly_comparison.png; organism: Vertebrate embryonic autopod (Mus musculus distal Hox/Gli3 allelic series & postaxial hexadactylous autopod radiograph); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 4ba645a060b448f2c2c1acc18c47a660ef9f21e12216d12473ce8eae3ddb3de8; artifact_sha256: dfa8cd3145a6bc603c86306ef4b4b1364dde5e2f875ee9290209fe26a6e6511f; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/hox_turing_polydactyly_reference.json=06c60968ccdce3a7..., datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/scout_manifest.json=c0608869f6d213a4..., datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/vertebrate_autopod_digits_specimen.jpg=995e43a2a0cf7815...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-hox-turing-polydactyly-audit" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.10.016>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1226804>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1252960>,
